"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:p008","text":"其明年，則元光元年，鴈門馬邑豪聶翁壹因大行王恢言上曰：「匈奴初和親，親信邊，可誘以利。」陰使聶翁壹爲閒，亡入匈奴，謂單于曰：「吾能斬馬邑令丞吏，以城降，財物可盡得。」單于愛信之，以爲然，許聶翁壹。聶翁壹乃還，詐斬死罪囚，縣其頭馬邑城，示單于使者爲信。曰：「馬邑長吏已死，可急來。」於是單于穿塞將十餘萬騎，入武州塞。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m008-0015","start":15,"end":18,"surface":"聶翁壹","kind":"person","person_id":"87t_93a_gy8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m008-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"王恢","kind":"person","person_id":"z2v_oh4_mhm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m008-0024","start":24,"end":25,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"zgv_3zp_3tg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m008-0046","start":46,"end":49,"surface":"聶翁壹","kind":"person","person_id":"87t_93a_gy8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m008-0058","start":58,"end":60,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"hn9_gz8_uyk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m008-0083","start":83,"end":85,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"hn9_gz8_uyk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m008-0094","start":94,"end":97,"surface":"聶翁壹","kind":"person","person_id":"87t_93a_gy8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m008-0098","start":98,"end":101,"surface":"聶翁壹","kind":"person","person_id":"87t_93a_gy8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m008-0106","start":106,"end":109,"surface":"死罪囚","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未明示姓名及人數，不由詐稱馬邑長吏補造令丞人物或身份。"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m008-0118","start":118,"end":120,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"hn9_gz8_uyk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m008-0120","start":120,"end":122,"surface":"使者","kind":"person","person_id":"v8p_xn6_zmf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m008-0142","start":142,"end":144,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"hn9_gz8_uyk","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-108-han","book_id":"b-shiji-108","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-108-han"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:p009","text":"當是時，漢伏兵車騎材官二十餘萬，匿馬邑旁谷中。衞尉李廣爲驍騎將軍，太仆公孫賀爲輕車將軍，大行王恢爲將屯將軍，太中大夫李息爲材官將軍。御史大夫韓安國爲護軍將軍，諸將皆屬護軍。約單于入馬邑而漢兵縱發。王恢、李息、李廣別從代主擊其輜重。於是單于入漢長城武州塞。未至馬邑百餘里，行掠鹵，徒見畜牧於野，不見一人。單于怪之，攻烽燧，得武州尉史。欲刺問尉史。尉史曰：「漢兵數十萬伏馬邑下。」單于顧謂左右曰：「幾爲漢所賣！」乃引兵還。出塞，曰：「吾得尉史，乃天也。」命尉史爲「天王」。塞下傳言單于已引去。漢兵追至塞，度弗及，即罷。王恢等兵三萬，聞單于不與漢合，度往擊輜重，必與單于精兵戰，漢兵勢必敗，則以便宜罷兵，皆無功。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"李廣","kind":"person","person_id":"njk_tl0_6h9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0035","start":35,"end":38,"surface":"公孫賀","kind":"person","person_id":"kwn_v70_fse","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"王恢","kind":"person","person_id":"z2v_oh4_mhm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0058","start":58,"end":60,"surface":"李息","kind":"person","person_id":"tmv_5d7_bx2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0070","start":70,"end":73,"surface":"韓安國","kind":"person","person_id":"adb_4so_0qm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0087","start":87,"end":89,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"hn9_gz8_uyk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0098","start":98,"end":100,"surface":"王恢","kind":"person","person_id":"z2v_oh4_mhm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0101","start":101,"end":103,"surface":"李息","kind":"person","person_id":"tmv_5d7_bx2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0104","start":104,"end":106,"surface":"李廣","kind":"person","person_id":"njk_tl0_6h9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0117","start":117,"end":119,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"hn9_gz8_uyk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0151","start":151,"end":153,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"hn9_gz8_uyk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0163","start":163,"end":165,"surface":"尉史","kind":"person","person_id":"2a2_j2z_xyc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0169","start":169,"end":171,"surface":"尉史","kind":"person","person_id":"2a2_j2z_xyc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0172","start":172,"end":174,"surface":"尉史","kind":"person","person_id":"2a2_j2z_xyc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0188","start":188,"end":190,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"hn9_gz8_uyk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0217","start":217,"end":219,"surface":"尉史","kind":"person","person_id":"2a2_j2z_xyc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0226","start":226,"end":228,"surface":"尉史","kind":"person","person_id":"2a2_j2z_xyc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0238","start":238,"end":240,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"hn9_gz8_uyk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0257","start":257,"end":259,"surface":"王恢","kind":"person","person_id":"z2v_oh4_mhm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0265","start":265,"end":267,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"hn9_gz8_uyk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m009-0280","start":280,"end":282,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"hn9_gz8_uyk","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-108-han","book_id":"b-shiji-108","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-108-han"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:p010","text":"天子怒王恢不出擊單于輜重，擅引兵罷也。恢曰：「始約虜入馬邑城，兵與單于接，而臣擊其輜重，可得利。今單于聞，不至而還，臣以三萬人眾不敵，禔取辱耳。臣固知還而斬，然得完陛下士三萬人。」於是下恢廷尉。廷尉當恢逗橈，當斬。恢私行千金丞相蚡。蚡不敢言上，而言於太后曰：「王恢首造馬邑事，今不成而誅恢，是爲匈奴報仇也。」上朝太后，太后以丞相言告上。上曰：「首爲馬邑事者，恢也，故發天下兵數十萬，從其言，爲此。且縱單于不可得，恢所部擊其輜重，猶頗可得，以慰士大夫心。今不誅恢，無以謝天下。」於是恢聞之，乃自殺。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m010-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"zgv_3zp_3tg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m010-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"王恢","kind":"person","person_id":"z2v_oh4_mhm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m010-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"hn9_gz8_uyk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m010-0019","start":19,"end":20,"surface":"恢","kind":"person","person_id":"z2v_oh4_mhm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m010-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"hn9_gz8_uyk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m010-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"單于","kind":"person","person_id":"hn9_gz8_uyk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m010-0093","start":93,"end":94,"surface":"恢","kind":"person","person_id":"z2v_oh4_mhm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m010-0094","start":94,"end":96,"surface":"廷尉","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"下恢廷尉為司法機構；廷尉當恢可為機構或未名官員，不據官稱補個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m010-0097","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"廷尉","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"下恢廷尉為司法機構；廷尉當恢可為機構或未名官員，不據官稱補個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m010-0100","start":100,"end":101,"surface":"恢","kind":"person","person_id":"z2v_oh4_mhm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-108-han:m010-0107","start":107,"end":108,"surface":"恢","kind":"person","person_id":"z2v_oh4_mhm","status":"contextual_provisional